                <pb facs="0808" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg720"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May 11,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay informs Mr. McCormick that the Japanese Government have no objection to
                    the use of the Japanese consular buildings at Vladivostok for Red Cross purposes
                    by the Russian authorities.)</p>
            </div>
